    "bug_fixes": [
      "A display left half-written by an interrupted update could not recover: every same-size re-upload was answered with a resume request at the broken state. The display image now ships at a NEW SIZE (a 200x200 pad picture parked on the unused spare page), which forces the display to erase and write the whole image cleanly from byte 0"
